  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Mistral Leanstral 1.5 119B A6B (Lean 4 code agent, 128-expert MoE, FP8, Apache-2.0) on two Sparks with stock vLLM v0.24.0, Ray, tensor parallel 2, 262144-token context, up to 7 concurrent sequences, text and image input, Mistral tool-call and reasoning parsers, eager mode. Basis: MiaAI-Lab's dual-Spark start.sh (no licence file upstream). Optional EAGLE draft (off by default; upstream reports it unstable). Upstream advises reasoning_effort none for general use and a context of 200k or less; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance is pending.",
